Local Paracetamol observability change for the pinned llama.cpp server.
Base upstream: c6fb3b5be2209f6c12339833198190f6f6829581.
Apply after the thirteen reviewed production patches (tree
9846481e57eca4ba98016ece1a0f1e1cdbe50ec7).

Expose the existing per-request accounted verification-round counter alongside
the existing draft counters. It does not count every verification attempt:
checkpoint restore/replay may add work before a round is accounted. No counter
updates, inference flow, arithmetic,
sampling, model or precision policy change. Ordinary requests retain their
existing timing fields without speculative keys. Remove when upstream exposes
an equivalent exact verification-step count and the matching-source JSON
fixture passes. This is a local patch, not an imported upstream proposal.

diff --git a/tools/server/server-common.cpp b/tools/server/server-common.cpp
--- a/tools/server/server-common.cpp
+++ b/tools/server/server-common.cpp
@@ -169,8 +169,9 @@ json server_slot_stats::to_json() const {
     };
 
     if (n_draft_tokens > 0) {
-        base["draft_n"]          = n_draft_tokens;
-        base["draft_n_accepted"] = n_draft_accepted;
+        base["draft_n"]           = n_draft_tokens;
+        base["draft_n_accepted"]  = n_draft_accepted;
+        base["draft_verif_steps"] = n_draft_verif_steps;
     }
 
     return base;
